    "title": "📢 Help selling your home before moving into senior living",
    "text": "1 days ago 📢 Help Selling a Home Before Moving to Senior Living\nIf you or a loved one wants to move into a senior living community but needs to sell a home first, there’s a local resource that can help reduce the stress and delays.\nFamilies in Sarasota, Bradenton and Charlotte Counties can talk with Sarasota Cash Home Buyers and Jeff Nemeth Real Estate to understand two main options:\nFast cash offer (through Sarasota Cash Home Buyers)\nSell the house as-is No repairs, cleaning, staging, showings, commissions, or financing contingencies Choose a flexible closing date that lines up with the move Traditional MLS listing (through Jeff Nemeth Real Estate)\nFull marketing and market-based pricing strategy Aim to maximize sale price if timing is more flexible They offer no-obligation, no-pressure consultations to explain both paths so seniors and families can decide what works best for their finances, timing, and care needs.\nTo learn more or request a consult, call Jeff Nemeth at 941-202-6957 .\nMore Info: Discover Comfortable Senior Living at Suncoast Clu...\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
